{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34003","headline":"南阳润卿将归雷平因而有赠 · 皮日休","name":"南阳润卿将归雷平因而有赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"借问山中许道士，此回归去复何如。\n竹屏风扇抄遗事，柘步舆竿系隐书。\n绦树实多分紫鹿，丹沙泉浅种红鱼。\n东卿旄节看看至，静啓茅斋慎扫除。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}